<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombia opened an embassy in Jerusalem while UN independent experts urged Ecopetrol to provide reparations to armed-conflict victims, and the United Kingdom reaffirmed support for the 2016 peace accord at the UN Security Council. A new surrender law targets armed groups and the peace tribunal charged former FARC members with anti-Indigenous crimes and war crimes against Indigenous groups. Rebels detonated a car bomb outside a toll booth in Cauca and FARC dissidents were killed in a Catatumbo operation and an army airstrike that also hit a teenager. Rescue operations continue after a plane crash that killed 71 and an earthquake that left more than 224 dead, and 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168580&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9iQ3JyeU1lQjBqOUtqcHZvOHRENnJpRnJzODNtZk1qSm02U002OXp2Vm5odkVpRTZpNWRXNTFOZENaeUtNU3NzLVhsNGdNZnBUcmdJdTFXSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxObUVqdXVtVUFCMDgyZ3c2dVptc2dndnQzTjdIRE9VLUM3MXMySDlfY2FqQkFfbmZyVGI2WkZIc0VyN2VmSTF1TEVqYXdNTEY4TDU2MHRlajlxem1mX29ta1p4NW1jUnBsZUQ4UjkyN1hPaWpzekpiYzV1bldQTi0tT1h3MVdLd28tR1FSY0pXVE9mTnV1WGlxNzlVM0lDLVdhYW5uQjhpckE1aVBoZ0hNb3hJLUlMdjZs0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBzYVVYZnBpQnFlMEFUQ3RCb2NrMERyQkhGQ1VCM0lIWm5zaXM5QkV6S2ZlQnpmNHZmNHROSXE1eHZYQ21waVFCVHJpZVd0c3BaQ3ZQUFduRkdlS1psczc5MXp5TWZOcDZmN2cwZlNDM185Y0hQbWtYcDlURk14TnhSeExrVm1NVndyRFJpcTRKVUNpOUsyTG9FejhMeEJ6WnpVRm05M0lKT3c1OEV5Nk84dUdGcDFmLXZTQnFZMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQZHVRY2JmVHRoUmpEV24xc2RlNTBRaEZDYXoxSGQ1SGJ